.nh
.TH "desync" "1" "Sep 2026" "desync" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
desync-completion-bash \- Generate the autocompletion script for bash


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBdesync completion bash\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Generate the autocompletion script for the bash shell.

.PP
This script depends on the 'bash-completion' package.
If it is not installed already, you can install it via your OS's package manager.

.PP
To load completions in your current shell session:

.EX
source <(desync completion bash)
.EE

.PP
To load completions for every new session, execute once:

.SS Linux:
.EX
desync completion bash > /etc/bash_completion.d/desync
.EE

.SS macOS:
.EX
desync completion bash > $(brew --prefix)/etc/bash_completion.d/desync
.EE

.PP
You will need to start a new shell for this setup to take effect.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for bash

.PP
\fB--no-descriptions\fP[=false]
	disable completion descriptions


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	config file (default $HOME/.config/desync/config.json)

.PP
\fB--digest\fP="sha512-256"
	digest algorithm, sha512-256 or sha256

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	verbose mode


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBdesync-completion(1)\fP


.SH "تاریخچه (HISTORY)"
